  "question": "Finance/Statistics model: $V=\\cot^{-1}\\Big(\\frac{y}{\\sqrt{x^2-1}}\\Big)$ with $x\\ge1$, $y>0$.<br /><br />(a) Express $V$ in terms of $\\sec^{-1}x$.<br /><br />(b) Compute $V$ for $x=2$, $y=1$.",
